  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    R = len(grid)\n    C = len(grid[0])\n    output_grid = [[0 for _ in range(C)] for _ in range(R)]\n    visited = set()\n\n    for r in range(R):\n        for c in range(C):\n            if grid[r][c] > 0 and (r, c) not in visited:\n                C_out = grid[r][c]\n                \n                # Find width and height\n                W = 0\n                while c + W < C and grid[r][c+W] == C_out:\n                    W += 1\n                H = 0\n                while r + H < R and grid[r+H][c] == C_out:\n                    H += 1\n                \n                if W > 2 and H > 2:\n                    C_in = grid[r+1][c+1]\n                    \n                    # Mark as visited\n                    for i in range(r, r+H):\n                        for j in range(c, c+W):\n                            visited.add((i, j))\n                            \n                    # Draw Top\n                    for i in range(r - (H-2), r):\n                        for j in range(c, c + W):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Bottom\n                    for i in range(r + H, r + H + H - 2):\n                        for j in range(c, c + W):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Left\n                    for i in range(r, r + H):\n                        for j in range(c - (W-2), c):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Right\n                    for i in range(r, r + H):\n                        for j in range(c + W, c + W + W - 2):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Center\n                    for i in range(r, r + H):\n                        for j in range(c, c + W):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                if i == r or i == r + H - 1 or j == c or j == c + W - 1:\n                                    output_grid[i][j] = C_in\n                                else:\n                                    output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                else:\n                    visited.add((r, c))\n\n    return output_grid\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    R = len(grid)\n    C = len(grid[0])\n    output_grid = [[0 for _ in range(C)] for _ in range(R)]\n    visited = set()\n\n    for r in range(R):\n        for c in range(C):\n            if grid[r][c] > 0 and (r, c) not in visited:\n                C_out = grid[r][c]\n                \n                # Find width and height\n                W = 0\n                while c + W < C and grid[r][c+W] == C_out:\n                    W += 1\n                H = 0\n                while r + H < R and grid[r+H][c] == C_out:\n                    H += 1\n                \n                if W > 2 and H > 2:\n                    C_in = grid[r+1][c+1]\n                    \n                    # Mark as visited\n                    for i in range(r, r+H):\n                        for j in range(c, c+W):\n                            visited.add((i, j))\n                            \n                    # Draw Top\n                    for i in range(r - (H-2), r):\n                        for j in range(c, c + W):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Bottom\n                    for i in range(r + H, r + H + H - 2):\n                        for j in range(c, c + W):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Left\n                    for i in range(r, r + H):\n                        for j in range(c - (W-2), c):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Right\n                    for i in range(r, r + H):\n                        for j in range(c + W, c + W + W - 2):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                    # Draw Center\n                    for i in range(r, r + H):\n                        for j in range(c, c + W):\n                            if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                                if i == r or i == r + H - 1 or j == c or j == c + W - 1:\n                                    output_grid[i][j] = C_in\n                                else:\n                                    output_grid[i][j] = C_out\n                else:\n                    visited.add((r, c))\n\n    return output_grid",
